('olipop', 'olipop', 'OLIPOP', 'food & drink', 'A new kind of soda with 3g sugar', 'https://drinkolipop.com', 'Orange Cream', 'Orange Cream', 'https://drinkolipop.com/products/orange-cream-minis', 'The summertime treat from your favorite ice cream truck. Orange Cream blends vanilla flavor with bursts of clementine and mandarin for a nostalgic sip of childhood joy.', '["Tastes like the orange cream treat from an ice cream truck", "Vanilla flavor with clementine and mandarin", "3g sugar, 3g fiber, 25 calories per mini can"]'::jsonb, 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0034/6610/0806/files/orange-cream-minis-olipop_single-can-main-image_new_asset.webp?v=1785416383', '/brands/olipop.png', 'https://agent.livepeer.org/a/aHR0cHM6Ly83eTRmbHpwdWxndjRjbzZyLnB1YmxpYy5ibG9iLnZlcmNlbC1zdG9yYWdlLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzE3OTAyNzYxNTYwMDgtZ2NqeTVyLnBuZw.4bb8d738c35ec46d/1790276156008-gcjy5r.png', 0.612, '#ec8146', 'soda cans, bottles or drinks'),
('liquid-death', 'liquid-death', 'Liquid Death', 'food & drink', 'Murder your thirst', 'https://liquiddeath.com', 'Mountain Water (Still)', 'Mountain Water', 'https://liquiddeath.com/products/mountain-water-still', 'Many bottled water brands are just processed municipal tap water in plastic bottles. But these ice cold recyclable cans of Mountain Water come from real American mountain ranges that produce some of the best water in the world. Real Mountain Source Ice Cold Cans Infinitely Recyclable Cans We Donate a Portion of Our Proceeds to Help Kill Plastic Pollution', '["Mountain water from real American mountain ranges", "Comes in ice cold, infinitely recyclable cans", "A portion of proceeds goes to killing plastic pollution"]'::jsonb, 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0079/4289/7737/files/LD-COM-PDP-AMW-12oz-12pk_Case-Front-Angle-12pk-12oz.webp?v=1783703878', '/brands/liquid-death.png', 'https://agent.livepeer.org/a/aHR0cHM6Ly83eTRmbHpwdWxndjRjbzZyLnB1YmxpYy5ibG9iLnZlcmNlbC1zdG9yYWdlLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzE3OTAyNzYxNTcwMjUtY3I4N2oyLnBuZw.a2a09bcff06dbc74/1790276157025-cr87j2.png', 1.257, '#ad956c', 'cans, bottles or drinks'),
('stanley', 'stanley', 'Stanley', 'lifestyle', 'Built for life', 'https://stanley1913.com', 'The Quencher H2.0 FlowState Tumbler', 'Quencher tumbler', 'https://stanley1913.com/products/quencher-h2-0-flowstate-tumbler-30-oz-0-88-l-bts', 'This Quencher H2.0 is generously sized (but not oversized) with an easy-carry, comfort-grip handle and a narrow base that will fit most cup holders. Long day of meetings? Rowing class? Trip out of town? Our durable 30 oz tumbler, made with recycled stainless steel, is up to the hydration challenge. The double-wall vacuum insulation will keep your water cold for 9 hours and iced for 40 hours. And to cap things off, there’s an advanced FlowState™ lid that features a rotating cover with three positions: a straw opening designed to resist splashes with a seal that holds the reusable straw in place', '["30 oz tumbler with a comfort grip handle", "Keeps water cold for 9 hours and iced for 40 hours", "Narrow base fits most cup holders, FlowState lid resists splashes"]'::jsonb, 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/3269/6635/files/Web_PNG_Square-The_Quencher_H2.0_Flowstate_Tumbler_30OZ_-_Blue_Dream_Wildflower_-_Front.png?v=1782915017', '/brands/stanley.png', 'https://agent.livepeer.org/a/aHR0cHM6Ly83eTRmbHpwdWxndjRjbzZyLnB1YmxpYy5ibG9iLnZlcmNlbC1zdG9yYWdlLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzE3OTAyNzYxNTc3MDItZnJpbXVmLnBuZw.80039bfad73fce23/1790276157702-frimuf.png', 0.543, '#97a7c0', 'cups, tumblers or bottles'),
('allbirds', 'allbirds', 'Allbirds', 'fashion', 'Comfy shoes made with natural materials', 'https://allbirds.com', 'Men''s Wool Runner - True Black (Cream Sole)', 'Wool Runners', 'https://allbirds.com/products/mens-wool-runners-true-black', 'The Allbirds Wool Runner is the orginal wool sneaker that started it all. Called the world''s most comfortable shoe, it''s flexible, supportive, astonishingly soft, and machine washable. The Wool Runner is breathable, lightweight, and can be worn sockless. Best used for walking, cooler weather, and everyday casual wear.', '["The original wool sneaker", "Flexible, supportive and super soft", "Machine washable, breathable, can be worn sockless"]'::jsonb, 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1104/4168/files/WR3MTBK_SHOE_LEFT_GLOBAL_MENS_WOOL_RUNNER_TRUE_BLACK_CREAM_e5a8bc76-ac77-4fd6-a372-52c8f970aa52.png?v=1751144635', '/brands/allbirds.png', 'https://agent.livepeer.org/a/aHR0cHM6Ly83eTRmbHpwdWxndjRjbzZyLnB1YmxpYy5ibG9iLnZlcmNlbC1zdG9yYWdlLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzE3OTAyNzYxNTg0OTkteGkzdmViLnBuZw.67c153ec26bf6491/1790276158499-xi3veb.png', 1.85, '#585654', 'shoes or sneakers'),
('keychron', 'keychron', 'Keychron', 'tech', 'Mechanical keyboards for creators and coders', 'https://keychron.com', 'Keychron Q1 HE 8K Magnetic Switch Keyboard', 'Q1 HE keyboard', 'https://keychron.com/products/keychron-q1-he-8k-magnetic-switch-keyboard', 'The Fully Assembled version includes: The keyboard PCB, the plate, the case, and the foams. Keycaps (including Mac &amp; Windows keycaps). Adjustable-actuation-point Keychron Ultra-fast Lime Magnetic Switch. Supports hot-swapping with Keychron Lime and Gateron Jade magnetic switches. To view the installation steps, please connect Q1 HE 8K to the Keychron Launcher &gt; Switch Type Setting.', '["Magnetic switch mechanical keyboard with adjustable actuation point", "8K polling rate", "Hot swappable switches, comes with Mac and Windows keycaps"]'::jsonb, 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0059/0630/1017/files/Keychron-Q1--HE--8K-Full-Size-Keychron-Ultra-fast-Lime-Magnetic-Switch-Keyboard-1.jpg?v=1761655109', '/brands/keychron.png', 'https://agent.livepeer.org/a/aHR0cHM6Ly83eTRmbHpwdWxndjRjbzZyLnB1YmxpYy5ibG9iLnZlcmNlbC1zdG9yYWdlLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzE3OTAyNzYxNTk0MjEtcWZjamoxLnBuZw.eff51d5efc0cf4a3/1790276159421-qfcjj1.png', 2.078, '#7174b3', 'keyboards'),
('glossier', 'glossier', 'Glossier', 'beauty', 'Skin first, makeup second', 'https://glossier.com', 'Balm Dotcom', 'Balm Dotcom', 'https://glossier.com/products/balm-dotcom', 'Instant nourishment with addictive taste. Our cult-favorite, do-everything lip balm. Swipe on for hydration you can feel and taste with a formula rich in antioxidants and natural emollients to nourish dryness. Key Ingredients: A hydrating lip balm packed with antioxidants + natural emollients to nourish dry, chafed skin. Castor Seed Oil Beeswax Lanolin Phyto-Antioxidant Blend Product Details: Moisturizing Nourishing Cruelty-free', '["Cult favorite do-everything lip balm", "Rich in antioxidants and natural emollients for dry lips", "Cruelty free"]'::jsonb, 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0627/9164/7477/files/glossier-bdc-wildfig-carousel-1.png?v=1762201257', '/brands/glossier.png', 'https://agent.livepeer.org/a/aHR0cHM6Ly83eTRmbHpwdWxndjRjbzZyLnB1YmxpYy5ibG9iLnZlcmNlbC1zdG9yYWdlLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzE3OTAyNzYxNjAwNjQtZGJwaW41LnBuZw.e706f0432930cc1e/1790276160064-dbpin5.png', 0.762, '#98a374', 'lip balm, tubes or cosmetics'),
('magic-spoon', 'magic-spoon', 'Magic Spoon', 'food & drink', 'Childhood favorites, high protein', 'https://magicspoon.com', 'Cocoa Cereal', 'Cocoa cereal', 'https://magicspoon.com/products/cocoa-7oz-box', 'Dark, rich, and made with real cocoa. We’ve reimagined your favorite chocolatey cereal with 4g net carbs, 13g complete protein, 140 calories, and no artificial ingredients.', '["Chocolatey cereal made with real cocoa", "13g complete protein and 4g net carbs per serving", "140 calories, no artificial ingredients"]'::jsonb, 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0081/3826/0542/products/MS-BYO-Cocoa-111821_2x_1_aaa66ff2-b559-42cd-b419-091e4fe63e6e-341389.png?v=1773357911', '/brands/magic-spoon.png', 'https://agent.livepeer.org/a/aHR0cHM6Ly83eTRmbHpwdWxndjRjbzZyLnB1YmxpYy5ibG9iLnZlcmNlbC1zdG9yYWdlLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzE3OTAyNzYxNjEwNzYtMXV0cTBkLnBuZw.2d124850dfcd88a7/1790276161076-1utq0d.png', 0.874, '#846999', 'cereal boxes or bowls of cereal'),
('graza', 'graza', 'Graza', 'food & drink', 'Olive oil in a squeeze bottle', 'https://graza.co', 'Drizzle', 'Drizzle olive oil', 'https://graza.co/products/drizzle', 'Like a sprinkle of flaky salt or the squeeze of a good condiment, Drizzle adds a big pop of flavor right before you dig in. (That’s why it’s called a finishing oil!) Drizzle’s flavors are sensitive, though, so keep it off the heat.', '["Extra virgin olive oil in a squeeze bottle", "A finishing oil for a big pop of flavor right before you eat", "Squeeze it on, no pouring mess"]'::jsonb, 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0550/0003/9638/files/driz.jpg?v=1762198146', '/brands/graza.png', 'https://agent.livepeer.org/a/aHR0cHM6Ly83eTRmbHpwdWxndjRjbzZyLnB1YmxpYy5ibG9iLnZlcmNlbC1zdG9yYWdlLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzE3OTAyNzYxNjE4NTItM2EydXh3LnBuZw.28d793afc94d9d62/1790276161852-3a2uxw.png', 0.439, '#7aa95d', 'bottles or olive oil'),
('ghost', 'ghost', 'GHOST', 'fitness', 'Energy drinks with legit flavors', 'https://drinkghost.com', 'GHOST ENERGY | OG', 'GHOST Energy', 'https://drinkghost.com/products/ghost®-energy-og', 'AUTHENTIC FLAVORS. ZERO SUGARS.* NO BS. This event, festival, and bar exclusive flavor speaks for itself and is crushable for any occasion. Rock it with your favorite mixer or enjoy solo!', '["Energy drink with authentic flavors", "Zero sugar", "Crushable on its own or with a mixer"]'::jsonb, 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0845/5998/7001/files/OGFront_b5090f47-67f3-4a61-9c9d-43229be0709c.webp?v=1756221881', '/brands/ghost.png', 'https://agent.livepeer.org/a/aHR0cHM6Ly83eTRmbHpwdWxndjRjbzZyLnB1YmxpYy5ibG9iLnZlcmNlbC1zdG9yYWdlLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzE3OTAyNzYxNjI1NTItNWVzbzFhLnBuZw.e5ed0330c6578dbe/1790276162552-5eso1a.png', 0.49, '#ced2d3', 'cans or drinks'),
('our-place', 'our-place', 'Our Place', 'home & kitchen', 'Cookware for the way you cook', 'https://fromourplace.com', 'Always Pan Duo', 'Always Pan', 'https://fromourplace.com/products/always-pan-duo', 'Two Always Pans, two sizes, endless versatility.', '["Two Always Pans in two sizes", "One pan that does the job of many", "Endless versatility in the kitchen"]'::jsonb, 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0024/4137/9915/files/our-place-product-hero-thumbnail-AlwaysPanDuo-char_05f9a8b0-48a8-4dfe-a553-700caddabba3.jpg?v=1741117233', '/brands/our-place.png', 'https://agent.livepeer.org/a/aHR0cHM6Ly83eTRmbHpwdWxndjRjbzZyLnB1YmxpYy5ibG9iLnZlcmNlbC1zdG9yYWdlLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzE3OTAyNzYxNjMwNDItMGR4dm5oLnBuZw.d7334ee1e6bec37b/1790276163042-0dxvnh.png', 2.448, '#c19e78', 'pans or cookware'),
('loop', 'loop', 'Loop', 'wellness', 'Earplugs for focus, sleep and noise', 'https://loopearplugs.com', 'Quiet', 'Loop Quiet earplugs', 'https://loopearplugs.com/products/quiet-1', 'Made for deeper focus, calmer travel and sleep, our Loop Quiet 1 earplugs muffle unwanted noise when you need it most. Powerful noise reduction 24 dB (SNR) of noise reduction for getting in your quiet bubble at home, work and beyond Designed with comfort in mind Flexible soft-touch silicone earplugs for dreamy comfort day and night Certified Hearing Protection High-quality hearing protection against damaging noise Customizable fit A wide range of ear tip sizes for a perfect fit, even in smaller ears Reusable &amp; easy to clean Find your calm anywhere with earplugs that are built to last', '["Earplugs for focus, travel and sleep", "24 dB noise reduction", "Soft silicone, reusable, multiple ear tip sizes"]'::jsonb, 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1442/3288/files/Adobe_Express_-_file_3.png?v=1778588353', '/brands/loop.png', 'https://agent.livepeer.org/a/aHR0cHM6Ly83eTRmbHpwdWxndjRjbzZyLnB1YmxpYy5ibG9iLnZlcmNlbC1zdG9yYWdlLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzE3OTAyNzYxNjM3MzYtcHZmdjByLnBuZw.3a01c33ea02a1817/1790276163736-pvfv0r.png', 0.792, '#753639', 'earplugs or headphones')
